description: Always use the standard OpenAPI/Swagger spec to read endpoint documentation instead of guessing from code.
---

# Use Swagger for API documentation

- The canonical API spec is `backend/api-spec.yaml` (OpenAPI 3.0).
- It is served at `http://localhost:3010/api-docs/` when the backend is running.
- Never infer request/response shapes from source code alone — check the OpenAPI spec first.
- If the spec is missing an endpoint, update `backend/api-spec.yaml` and the backend code together.
